sequenceDiagram
  participant C as GitGit Client
  participant G as GitGit Rust Core
  participant M as MinIOS3 Manifest API
  participant D as MinIOS3 Data Nodes
  participant O as GitGit Outbox
  C->>M: BeginUpload/ChunkManifest
  loop Each missing chunk
    C->>D: PUT chunk (scoped session)
    D-->>M: durable receipt + SHA
  end
  C->>M: SealManifest(full SHA, contiguous chunk refs)
  M->>M: Verify data durable + policy epoch
  M-->>C: Signed durable receipt, ManifestId
  C->>G: PrepareCommit(expected RefRevision, tree, receipts)
  G->>M: Verify receipts and permissions
  M-->>G: Valid through fenced epoch
  G-->>C: Prepared ticket
  C->>G: PublishCommit(ticket, idempotency key)
  G->>G: Atomically Commit + Ref CAS + Outbox append
  G-->>C: CommitID + RefRevision + OutboxSeq
  G-->>O: Deliver signed committed event (at least once)
